<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <title>Verified forecasts · Greyhound</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/operator-ui.css?v={{ config.get('OPERATOR_UI_DEPLOYED_COMMIT', 'development') }}">
  <script src="/static/js/operator-ui-forecasts.js?v={{ config.get('OPERATOR_UI_DEPLOYED_COMMIT', 'development') }}" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="race-dashboard">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#forecast-content">Skip to forecasts</a>
  <div class="console-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="Console navigation">
      <div class="brand"><span class="brand__mark" aria-hidden="true">GH</span><span><strong>Greyhound</strong><small>Forecast console</small></span></div>
      <nav aria-label="Console sections"><ul class="nav-list nav-list--primary">
        <li><a href="/operator-ui#upcoming-races">Today</a></li>
        <li><a href="/operator-ui/forecasts" aria-current="page">Forecasts</a></li>
        <li><a href="#forecast-system">System</a></li>
      </ul></nav>
      <p class="sidebar__note">Private console. Historical forecasts remain available when current inputs are out of date.</p>
    </aside>
    <div class="workspace forecast-page">
      <header class="topbar"><div><p class="eyebrow">Retained and verified</p><h1>Forecasts</h1></div><strong class="research-warning">RESEARCH ONLY — NOT FOR BETTING</strong></header>
      <main id="forecast-content">
        <section class="forecast-intro" aria-labelledby="forecast-intro-title">
          <div><h2 id="forecast-intro-title">Understand the race probabilities</h2>
          <p>Compare the model with the captured WIN market for each runner. Market probabilities are normalized to add up to 100% within the race. A positive difference means the model assigns a higher probability than the market; it does not establish an advantage or explain why.</p>
          <p><a href="/operator-ui#upcoming-races">Upcoming races</a> · <a href="/operator-ui#manual-prediction">Run prediction</a></p></div>
          <button id="refresh-forecasts" class="primary-button" type="button">Refresh display</button>
        </section>
        <p id="forecast-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading authenticated forecasts…</p>
        <div id="forecast-sources"></div>
        <details class="system-details" id="forecast-system">
          <summary><span>Collection status and technical evidence</span><small>Current readiness and programme schedule</small></summary>
          <div class="system-details__content">
            <section class="panel"><h2>October programme</h2><div id="programme-status"></div></section>
            <section class="panel"><h2>Collector freshness and readiness</h2><div id="collector-status">Checking current collector evidence…</div></section>
          </div>
        </details>
      </main>
      <footer><strong>RESEARCH ONLY — NOT FOR BETTING</strong><span>Historical forecasts describe the inputs captured before the scheduled jump.</span></footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
